WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:04.000
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.480
- [Haida] Wow, that is bad!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.740
- [Fenneko] I wouldn't wear that on a bet.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.090
- Who sends this to their
25-year-old daughter?

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.209
- Maybe it's in a mom's DNA
to be a pain in the butt.

00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:16.209
(heavy-metal music)

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.888
- Any men in your life I
should know about dear?

00:00:19.888 --> 00:00:20.721
(ding and spit)

00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:22.130
Getting married and having a family

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.900
is a regular part of growing up.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.610
You know that I'm right, don't you?

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.000
You can't just skate through life.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.560
- [Washimi] Huh? She's marrying you off?

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.980
- Retsuko, you're getting married?

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.703
- [Retsuko] Lay off already!

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.760
- I'm gonna work in the
accounting department

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.700
starting today! My name's Anai!

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.320
- Work ain't all drinks on the back nine.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.370
We'll see how chipper
you are when someone's

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:44.870
busy hating you!

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.334
- I'm sorry, dear, but you
can't be a kid forever.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:50.285
- Oh crap, oh crap, oh crap,
oh crap, oh crap, oh crap,

00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:52.619
oh crap! He's gonna think I blew him off.

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:53.760
This is the end of the world!

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.545
(hopeful music)

00:00:55.545 --> 00:00:57.751
- [Tadano] What are your
thoughts on marriage?

00:00:57.751 --> 00:00:59.800
- [Retsuko] I think
that I'll do it someday,

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.843
as far as I know.

00:01:01.756 --> 00:01:03.210
- {Haida] What's this
apple-holding son-of-a-bitch

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:04.900
want with a girl like Retsuko?

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.760
He's gonna get bored and break her heart!

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.110
That's why I gotta punch
him right in the face!

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:13.310
- I think it's time...to live for me.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.560
[dramatic music]

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.097
- [Tadano] I hope I get
to be with you forever.

00:01:25.097 --> 00:01:28.159
(hopeful music)

00:01:28.159 --> 00:01:29.576
- [Retsuko] Yeah.

